sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = TransactionEvent, evse.id = <Configured evseId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be TransactionEvent<br>evse.id must be <Configured evseId>

    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (evse.id = <Configured evseId>, triggerReason = Trigger, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging, meterValue present, meterValue[0].sampledValue.context = Trigger)

    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
